# LINE for Loon - domain-based remote rules
# Updated: 2026-11-01
# Import into Loon > Configuration > Rules > Remote Rules
# Select your LINE proxy policy (prefer Japan/Taiwan depending on availability).
# This file contains no policy names by design.
# No MITM, rewrite, DNS override, UDP port override, or IP-CIDR.
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,line.me
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,line-apps.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,line-scdn.net
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,line.naver.jp
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,line-cdn.net
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,line.biz
